00:05:01.610 --> 00:05:06.610
This work does not move without
interaction and exchange.

00:05:07.670 --> 00:05:11.330
The second is to build a
robust, diverse network

00:05:11.330 --> 00:05:15.700
of students, organizers,
academics, and researchers

00:05:15.700 --> 00:05:18.560
who elevates students
and families to build

00:05:18.560 --> 00:05:22.040
authentic integration
and anti-racist education

00:05:22.040 --> 00:05:25.620
as they see it so that
all people may thrive.

00:05:25.620 --> 00:05:29.350
To that end, I ask that you
consider the unique strengths

00:05:29.350 --> 00:05:31.080
of each person here.

00:05:31.080 --> 00:05:33.740
The school integration
movement cannot happen

00:05:34.685 --> 00:05:35.720
without each person here.

00:05:36.760 --> 00:05:40.080
And consider the ways that
you might provide resources,

00:05:40.080 --> 00:05:43.770
networks, expertise to
support anyone here.

00:05:43.770 --> 00:05:46.540
And at the end, when we
ask you to take action,

00:05:46.540 --> 00:05:49.170
I ask that you do it in
exchange for the hour

00:05:49.170 --> 00:05:50.400
that folks here have given

00:05:50.400 --> 00:05:52.203
with their wisdom and their story.

